# Committed on purpose: NEXT_PUBLIC_* values are inlined into the client bundle
# at build time, so a deployment cannot read them from anywhere else. Both are
# publishable — the anon key is public by design and constrained by RLS.
# Secrets (SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY, ANTHROPIC_API_KEY) are NOT here; set them
# in Vercel → Settings → Environment Variables.
